> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2298:Marking the Devising log
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2299:
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2300:These are the mark schemes to be used for the Devising log in Component 2. They 
are level of
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2301:response mark schemes.
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2302:
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2303:Level of response mark schemes are broken down into levels, each of which has a 
descriptor. The
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2304:descriptor for the level shows the average performance. There are marks in each 
level. Before you
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2305:apply the mark scheme to a student’s response you should review the response.
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2306:
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2307:Step 1 Determine a level – Start at the lowest level of the mark scheme and use it 
as a ladder to
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2308:see whether the response meets the descriptor for that level. The descriptors for 
the level indicate
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2309:the different qualities that might be seen in the student’s response. If the 
response meets the
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2310:lowest level then go to the next one and decide if it meets this level, and so on, 
until you have a
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2311:match between the level descriptors and the response.
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2312:
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2313:When assigning a level look at the overall quality of the response. If the 
response covers different
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2314:aspects of different levels of the mark scheme you should use a best fit approach 
and use the
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2315:variability of the response to decide the mark within the level, ie if the 
response is predominantly
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2316:level 3 with a small amount of level 4 material it would be placed in level 3 but 
awarded a mark
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:2317:near the top because of the level 4 content.
