  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4930:
> specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4931:All your students’ work for Component 3 will be marked by a visiting AQA assessor. 
The visit will
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4932:be by arrangement and take place over the course of the certificating year.
