  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4935:
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4936:All NEA evidence, including an audiovisual recording of all performances seen on 
the day of the
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4937:visit, must be posted to the examiner. It must arrive within 10 working days of 
