  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4989:Every specification is given a national discount (classification) code by the 
Department for
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:4990:Education (DfE), which indicates its subject area.
  specs\aqa\drama-8261-8261.md:5050:There are no previous learning requirements. Any requirements for entry to a 
