+  },
+  {
+    "lesson": 6,
+    "field": "content_html",
+    "find": "The choice is not arbitrary: the Capulets are the family with social power in Verona, and warm, saturated colours read as dominant on stage.",
+    "replace": "The colours can distinguish the families without implying different social rank: the Prologue calls them &ldquo;both alike in dignity,&rdquo; while warm, saturated colours can read as dominant on stage.",
